{"ref":"BDB, רָצוֹן","hw":"רָצוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָצוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>goodwill, favour, acceptance, will</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.23\">Dt 33:23</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:19\" href=\"/Psalms.145.19\">ψ 145:19</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצוֹנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.10\">Is 60:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְצֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:4\" href=\"/Daniel.8.4\">Dn 8:4</a> +, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>goodwill, favour:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of God, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.16\">Dt 33:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.10\">Is 60:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:13\" href=\"/Psalms.5.13\">ψ 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:6\" href=\"/Psalms.30.6\">30:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:8\" href=\"/Psalms.30.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:20\" href=\"/Psalms.51.20\">51:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:18\" href=\"/Psalms.89.18\">89:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:4\" href=\"/Psalms.106.4\">106:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:35\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.35\">Pr 8:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.2\">12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.22\">18:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵת ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.8\">Is 49:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:14\" href=\"/Psalms.69.14\">ψ 69:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.5\">Is 58:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת־ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.2\">Is 61:2</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרָכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.23\">Dt 33:23</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹעֵכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.1\">Pr 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.22\">12:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.8\">15:8</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of men: in gen. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.32\">Pr 10:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.27\">11:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.9\">14:9</a>; of kings v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:35\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.35\">35</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.13\">16:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.12\">19:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>acceptance</em>, of persons, offering sacrifice, <span dir=\"rtl\">לרצון לפני יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:38\" href=\"/Exodus.28.38\">Ex 28:38</a> (P); c. ל pers. <em>for acceptance for him before</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; c. sf. pers. <span dir=\"rtl\">לרצנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.3\">Lv 1:3</a>; abbrev. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְרָצוֹן לָכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.20\">22:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לרצנכם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.5\">19:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.19\">22:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.11\">23:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לרצון</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.21\">22:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.7\">Is 56:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.20\">Je 6:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:15\" href=\"/Psalms.19.15\">ψ 19:15</a> (of words; cf. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:3\" href=\"/Hosea.14.3\">Ho 14:3</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">על רצון</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.7\">Is 60:7</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>, so Codd., v. Gi, also Du), <span dir=\"rtl\">רצון</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:13\" href=\"/Malachi.2.13\">Mal 2:13</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>will, desire, pleasure:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of God, <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה ר׳</span> <em>do</em> his <em>will</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:11\" href=\"/Ezra.10.11\">Ezr 10:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:9\" href=\"/Psalms.40.9\">ψ 40:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:21\" href=\"/Psalms.103.21\">103:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:10\" href=\"/Psalms.143.10\">143:10</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of man, <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה כרצונוֹ</span> <em>do according to his will</em>, exactly as he pleased, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:4\" href=\"/Daniel.8.4\">Dn 8:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:3\" href=\"/Daniel.11.3\">11:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:16\" href=\"/Daniel.11.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:36\" href=\"/Daniel.11.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.24\">Ne 9:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:8\" href=\"/Esther.1.8\">Est 1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:5\" href=\"/Esther.9.5\">9:5</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9:37</a>; <em>desire</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:16\" href=\"/Psalms.145.16\">ψ 145:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:19\" href=\"/Psalms.145.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.15\">2 Ch 15:15</a>; = self-will <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:6\" href=\"/Genesis.49.6\">Gn 49:6</a> (poem).","next":"BDB, תִּרְצָה","prev":"BDB, רָצָה"}